ng concept!  We are using the truck again this year as it has been such a hot item!!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2017-07-31 03:14:02\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Mario was freaking amazing !!!! He was so charismatic and instinctful !! He's defiantly a one man show !! I would refer him for any event !! He bartender my friend Pilar wedding and did a amazing job !!!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Rasta Taco Catering is a highly-rated business located at 3375 Foothill Rd, Ste 6333 in Carpinteria, California. It offers a variety of services including catering, event planning, food delivery, and bartending, with a specific focus on Mexican cuisine. Its business hours are from 8:00 am to 5:00 pm on weekdays, and 9:00 am to 2:00 pm on weekends. Customers rave about the business's ability to enhance events with their services. Notable mentions include a margarita truck that adds a fun atmosphere to parties and a charismatic staff member named Mario. It has been noted that Rasta Taco Catering is a hit at military events and weddings. The business also offers street parking and outdoor seating to its customers.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":786},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":786,\"byte_end\":832},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":832,\"byte_end\":893},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":893,\"byte_end\":944},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":944,\"byte_end\":990},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":990,\"byte_end\":1146},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1146,\"byte_end\":1219},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1219,\"byte_end\":1271},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1271,\"byte_end\":1375},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1375,\"byte_end\":1401},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1401,\"byte_end\":1578},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1578,\"byte_end\":1619},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1619,\"byte_end\":1652},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1652,\"byte_end\":1687},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1687,\"byte_end\":1766}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6],