0.37.077.217 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"3375 Foothill Rd, Ste 6333\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":null,\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":false,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Caterers, Restaurants, Mexican, Event Planning & Services, Food, Tacos, Bartenders, Food Delivery Services\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Carpinteria\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"9:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"9:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Rasta Taco Catering\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2019-10-17 02:27:02\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Absolutely wonderful way to spice up any event! Mario and his crew knock it out of the park!  The margarita truck added such a fun atmosphere to my party! Highly recommend the cucumber jalapeno margarita!  I would book this for any future event here!  Thank you Rasta Rita!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-07-12 16:42:49\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Rasta Rita was used for a military event and was such a hit! Mario is super friendly to work with and is always willing to help out.  The truck was so fun and the drinks were delicious! Everyone at our event had such a fun time interacting with the truck and sipping the yummy margaritas.  What an amazing concept!  We are using the truck again this year as it has been such a hot item!!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2017-07-31 03:14:02\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Mario was freaking amazing !!!! He was so charismatic and instinctful !! He's defiantly a one man show !! I would refer him for any event !! He bartender my friend Pilar wedding and did a amazing job !!!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Rasta Taco Catering is a highly-rated business located at 3375 Foothill Rd, Ste 6333 in Carpinteria, California. It offers a variety of services including catering, event planning, food delivery, and bartending, with a specific focus on Mexican cuisine. Its business hours are from 8:00 am to 5:00 pm on weekdays, and 9:00 am to 2:00 pm on weekends. Customers rave about the business's ability to enhance events with their services. Notable mentions include a margarita truck that adds a fun atmosphere to parties and a charismatic staff member named Mario. It has been noted that Rasta Taco Catering is a hit at military events and weddings. The business also offers street parking and outdoor seating to its customers.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":786},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":786,\"byte_end\":832},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":832,\"byte_end\":893},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":893,\"byte_end\":944},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":944,\"byte_end\":990},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":990,\"byte_end\":1146},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1146,\"byte_end\":1219},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1219,\"byte_end\":1271},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1271,\"byte_end\":1375},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1375,\"byte_end\":1401},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1401,\"byte_end\":1578},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1578,\"byte_end\":1619},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1619,\"byte_end\":1652},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1652,\"byte_end\":1687},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1687,\"byte_end\":