ith his hand and forearms. Two other males joined in, police said. The attackers fled. The man, who asked not to be identified, was treated at the scene for injuries and didn't go to the hospital.\\n\",\"answer\":\"Two men, one 21-year-old Ronald Williams and a 15-year-old, were arrested for assault after they beat a 43-year-old man on a MetroLink train in St. Louis. The victim said the attack may have been prompted by a question about the Michael Brown shooting, but the suspects will not face hate crime charges as the evidence did not support the necessary elements for the charge.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":166},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":166,\"byte_end\":232},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":232,\"byte_end\":296},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":296,\"byte_end\":450},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":450,\"byte_end\":525},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":525,\"byte_end\":554},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":554,\"byte_end\":886},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":886,\"byte_end\":1019},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1019,\"byte_end\":1077},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1077,\"byte_end\":1181},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1181,\"byte_end\":1371},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1371,\"byte_end\":1450},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1450,\"byte_end\":1564},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1564,\"byte_end\":1695},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1695,\"byte_end\":1735},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1735,\"byte_end\":1755},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":1755,\"byte_end\":1865}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":155},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":155,\"byte_end\":373}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
