\\\":\\n\\nTo play Farkle, each player takes turns rolling all 6 dice. If no point dice appear (a Farkle), the player loses any points collected during that turn and play passes to the left. If the player chooses not to risk rolling a Farkle, they can stop rolling and record their points on the scratch paper. Points are awarded for sets of three of a kind (2,500 points), four of a kind (1,000 points or double/quadruple three of a kind value), and five of a kind (2,000 points or triple/six times three of a kind value). The objective is to have the highest score after 10 rounds of play.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":46},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":46,\"byte_end\":138},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":138,\"byte_end\":275},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":275,\"byte_end\":344},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":344,\"byte_end\":522},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":522,\"byte_end\":577},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":577,\"byte_end\":701},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":701,\"byte_end\":840},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":840,\"byte_end\":885},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":885,\"byte_end\":1013},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1013,\"byte_end\":1091},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1091,\"byte_end\":1215},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1215,\"byte_end\":1338},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1338,\"byte_end\":1491}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":32},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":32,\"byte_end\":185},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":185,\"byte_end\":305},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":305,\"byte_end\":425},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":425,\"byte_end\":638},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":638,\"byte_end\":705}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
