the personable staff, mentioning Nikki as a wonderful asset to the restaurant. They also commend the food quality, stating that they came in for just coffee but left with their bellies pleasantly full and even a to-go box. The restaurant does not offer outdoor seating and information about business hours, parking, Wi-Fi, take-out service, suitability for groups, music, and ambience is not provided.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":466},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":466,\"byte_end\":602},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":602,\"byte_end\":649},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":649,\"byte_end\":666},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":666,\"byte_end\":773},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":773,\"byte_end\":910},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":910,\"byte_end\":936}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":91},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":91,\"byte_end\":173},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":173,\"byte_end\":213},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":213,\"byte_end\":379},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":379,\"byte_end\":488},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":488,\"byte_end\":632},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":632,\"byte_end\":810}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
