esher even tho it's the same shit just trying to take our money, still going to Von's in other locations and by the way your stores are like ghost towns you ain't gonna survive hahahahah\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Haggen Food & Pharmacy is a grocery store located at 163 S Turnpike Rd in Goleta, California. They offer a variety of products including specialty food, delis, bakeries, restaurants, and health markets. However, according to customer reviews, the store has several issues that need improvement. One customer complained about the stale ice cream, while another criticized the store for its high prices and lack of organic options. Additionally, some customers expressed frustration with the store's layout and lack of parking. Despite these issues, Haggen Food & Pharmacy continues to operate in Goleta.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":923},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":923,\"byte_end\":979},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":979,\"byte_end\":1088},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1088,\"byte_end\":1251},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1251,\"byte_end\":1586}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":94},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":94,\"byte_end\":203},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":203,\"byte_end\":295},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":295,\"byte_end\":430},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":430,\"byte_end\":526},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":526,\"byte_end\":602}]}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
