 is extremely consistent and is of a slightly higher grade than anyplace else in town. The cold Sake list is affordable but good and the special board is local and or seasonal changing weekly or so. Best sushi in town. Ambiance is nice but its geared towards foodies and all the $ seems to be on the plates.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Teru Japanese Cuisine is a highly rated restaurant located in Santa Barbara, California, offering a variety of traditional Japanese dishes and a unique atmosphere. According to customer reviews, the restaurant boasts fresh seafood options and excellent service, with the owner and staff being particularly welcoming. The menu features a range of options, including sushi, as well as beer and wine, and the ambiance is described as casual yet classy. Customers have praised the quality of the food and the value for money, with some mentioning that it is one of the best sushi restaurants in the area. Overall, Teru Japanese Cuisine appears to be a top choice for those looking for authentic Japanese cuisine in a cozy and inviting setting.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":850},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":850,\"byte_end\":866},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":866,\"byte_end\":915},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":915,\"byte_end\":937},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":937,\"byte_end\":1049},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1049,\"byte_end\":1248},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1248,\"byte_end\":1306},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1306,\"byte_end\":1401},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1401,\"byte_end\":1513},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1513,\"byte_end\":1533},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1533,\"byte_end\":1638}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":164},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":164,\"byte_end\":317},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":317,\"byte_end\":450},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":450,\"byte_end\":601},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":601,\"byte_end\":739}]}<|im_end|>