ial issues. During the stops, Cruz took time to meet with voters individually and answered questions about religion and homosexual rights. He also spoke out against criticism of the religious freedom law in Indiana, describing it as an assault on First Amendment rights. Cruz plans to continue campaigning in Iowa and other early primary states in the coming months, hoping to energize the state's evangelical voting bloc.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":223},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":223,\"byte_end\":374},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":374,\"byte_end\":428},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":428,\"byte_end\":512},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":512,\"byte_end\":703},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":703,\"byte_end\":816},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":816,\"byte_end\":996},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":996,\"byte_end\":1088},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1088,\"byte_end\":1243},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1243,\"byte_end\":1474},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1474,\"byte_end\":1744},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1744,\"byte_end\":1814},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1814,\"byte_end\":1983},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1983,\"byte_end\":2220},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":2220,\"byte_end\":2412},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2412,\"byte_end\":2509},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2509,\"byte_end\":2700},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2700,\"byte_end\":2767},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":2767,\"byte_end\":2841},{\"index\":19,\"byte_start\":2841,\"byte_end\":2969},{\"index\":20,\"byte_start\":2969,\"byte_end\":3103},{\"index\":21,\"byte_start\":3103,\"byte_end\":3164},{\"index\":22,\"byte_start\":3164,\"byte_end\":3289},{\"index\":23,\"byte_start\":3289,\"byte_end\":3386},{\"index\":24,\"byte_start\":3386,\"byte_end\":3594},{\"index\":25,\"byte_start\":3594,\"byte_end\":3677},{\"index\":26,\"byte_start\":3677,\"byte_end\":3883},{\"index\":27,\"byte_start\":3883,\"byte_end\":3946},{\"index\":28,\"byte_start\":3946,\"byte_end\":4188},{\"index\":29,\"byte_start\":4188,\"byte_end