3.16.504.313 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"23 E Canon Perdido St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":true,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":true,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":true,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":true,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Wine Tasting Room, Jazz & Blues, Tapas Bars, Wineries, Food, Wine Bars, Champagne Bars, Music Venues, Arts & Entertainment, Restaurants, Bakeries, Bars, Nightlife\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"15:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"15:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"12:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"12:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"12:0-20:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Sevtap Winery Tasting Room\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-23 21:10:06\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I had the Clay Pot Shrimp W/ Chorizo. It was awesome.  It came with a beautiful fresh loaf of bread that you \\\\ncan buy separately.  I would courage you to try this place out.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-11 16:04:18\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Sevtap is great! They're in an awesome location with a convenient parking garage right nearby. They have options for indoor or outdoor seating. The staff are 