o-produced by director Brett Ratner. The movie will showcase how music can transport you back in time and it's expected to be the perfect Christmas movie fans of Mariah Carey would hope for.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":48},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":48,\"byte_end\":125},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":125,\"byte_end\":270},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":270,\"byte_end\":351},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":351,\"byte_end\":430},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":430,\"byte_end\":479},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":479,\"byte_end\":533},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":533,\"byte_end\":538},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":538,\"byte_end\":683},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":683,\"byte_end\":697},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":697,\"byte_end\":726},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":726,\"byte_end\":906},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":906,\"byte_end\":992},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":992,\"byte_end\":1020},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1020,\"byte_end\":1067},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1067,\"byte_end\":1297},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":1297,\"byte_end\":1320},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":1320,\"byte_end\":1440},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":1440,\"byte_end\":1465}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":70},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":70,\"byte_end\":171},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":171,\"byte_end\":324}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
