3.33.135.878 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"prompt":"<|im_start|>user\n{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"651 Paseo Nuevo\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":false,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":true,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":null,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"American (Traditional), Restaurants, Shopping Centers, Shopping, Local Flavor\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"9:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:0-19:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"11:0-19:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:0-19:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:0-19:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:0-19:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Paseo Nuevo Shopping Center\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-12 01:33:55\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Paseo Nuevo is one of the few malls in America that has successfully managed to stay afloat after all these years. \\\\n\\\\nThis outdoor mall feels very authentic and gives off an non-commercialized \\\\\\\"Santa Barbara\\\\\\\" vibe even though there are a good amount of chain stores here. Even with the steady decline of the American shopping mall, Paseo Nuevo sure can hold its own. \\\\n\\\\nThe mall received a high-budget refresh and looks great. I feel that although the before version was just fine, a fresh coat of paint and new paver pathways (among other enhancements) really brought this place into the current decade. \\\\n\\\\nNo matter which corner of Paseo Nuevo you happen to be at, you're sure to be in for a treat. The mall is adorned with beautiful plants and ornate ironwork, and I feel that most every shop is occupied which is a welcome change to vacant State Street. You'll find all types of small boutiques and little cafes here for your enjoyment. While the two anchor retail stores no longer occupy the mall, there's talk that one of them will be transitioning to a roller rink which I look forward to seeing. \\\\n\\\\nA great plaza overall. The American mall is not dead!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-09 03:33:11\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Everything closes at 7pm?! Everyday. Even weekends. Tried to do some shopping after work but nope. Amazon it is I guess.  No wonder none of the businesses make it.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-07-11 22:34:28\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Don't park your bike in the garage! One of our bikes got stolen here! Security was no help. There's no cameras in the garage either.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Here is an objective overview of Paseo Nuevo Shopping Center based on the provided structured data in JSON format:\\n\\nPaseo Nuevo Shopping Center is a popular shopping destination in Santa Barbara, California, offering a mix of local boutiques and eateries set amidst beautifully landscaped gardens and ornate ironwork. With a rich history dating back to the early 1980s, this outdoor mall has undergone significant renovations in recent years to maintain its appeal and relevance in the ever-changing retail landscape.\\n\\nThe center boasts a diverse range of tenants, including restaurants, clothing stores, and specialty shops, as well as two anchor retail stores. Although the mall's hours are limited, with most businesses closing at 7 pm every day, including weekends, the venue remains a popular spot for locals and visitors alike, thanks to its charming atmosphere and variety of offerings.\\n\\nOne reviewer praised the mall's authentic feel and non-commercialized vibe, while another appreciated the recent updates and improvements, such as fresh paint and new pathways. However, some patrons have complained about the limited hours and lack of camera surveillance in the parking garage, which may pose a concern for security.\\n\\nOverall, Paseo Nuevo Shopping Center offers a unique and enjoyable shopping experience in a beautiful setting, with a mix of local flavor and modern amenities.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":964},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":964,\"byte_end\":1124},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1124,\"byte_end\":1219},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1219,\"byte_end\":1280},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1280,\"byte_end\":1458},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1458,\"byte_end\":1555},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1555,\"byte_end\":1712},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1712,\"byte_end\":1795},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1795,\"byte_end\":1958},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1958,\"byte_end\":1985},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1985,\"byte_end\":2116},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":2116,\"byte_end\":2126},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":2126,\"byte_end\":2141},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":2141,\"byte_end\":2188},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":2188,\"byte_end\":2211},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2211,\"byte_end\":2362},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2362,\"byte_end\":2396},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2396,\"byte_end\":2418},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":2418,\"byte_end\":2475}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":318},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":318,\"byte_end\":519},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":519,\"byte_end\":663},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":663,\"byte_end\":895},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":895,\"byte_end\":1072},{\"index\":5,\"byte_st