fore you have children.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"what are some reasons genetic testing is done\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Genetic testing is done to identify changes in chromosomes, genes, or proteins. The results can confirm or rule out a suspected genetic condition or help determine a person’s chance of developing or passing on a genetic disorder. Genetic testing is often done if a person has symptoms of a disease that may be caused by genetic alterations, or if they have a family history of a genetic disorder. It can also be done if a person is in an ethnic group that has a high risk of a particular genetic disorder. Additionally, early genetic screening can be an important step in planning for a healthy family, particularly if one or both parents are carriers of a genetic disease.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":125},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":125,\"byte_end\":488},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":488,\"byte_end\":648},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":648,\"byte_end\":750},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":750,\"byte_end\":1043},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1043,\"byte_end\":1290},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1290,\"byte_end\":1433},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1433,\"byte_end\":1752}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":80},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":80,\"byte_end\":232},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":232,\"byte_end\":399},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":399,\"byte_end\":508},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":508,\"byte_end\":675}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
