and the server kept telling them to give her a minute. A third reviewer gave the cafe three stars and noted that the umbrellas on the patio did not provide enough shade on a hot day, and the staff was rushed and did not pay much attention to them. However, they enjoyed the food, which was good but not particularly impressive. Overall, while Derf's Cafe may have some areas for improvement, it appears to offer a decent dining experience and good food.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":859},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":859,\"byte_end\":877},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":877,\"byte_end\":939},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":939,\"byte_end\":1092},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1092,\"byte_end\":1108},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1108,\"byte_end\":1130},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1130,\"byte_end\":1155},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1155,\"byte_end\":1165},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1165,\"byte_end\":1188},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1188,\"byte_end\":1693},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1693,\"byte_end\":1964},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1964,\"byte_end\":2154},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":2154,\"byte_end\":2212},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":2212,\"byte_end\":2235},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":2235,\"byte_end\":2263},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2263,\"byte_end\":2295},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2295,\"byte_end\":2389},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2389,\"byte_end\":2432},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":2432,\"byte_end\":2467},{\"index\":19,\"byte_start\":2467,\"byte_end\":2524},{\"index\":20,\"byte_start\":2524,\"byte_end\":2604}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[8,9,10],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":66},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":66,\"byte_end\":138},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":138,\"byte_end\":195},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":195,\"byte_end\":243},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":243,\"byte_end\":469},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":469,\"byte_end\":521},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":521,\"byte_end\":588},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start