nt to the enduring respect and gratitude our community holds for those who have served.\\nLet us come together to honor Corporal Forrest's memory and service, ensuring that his contributions to our nation are celebrated and remembered with the dignity they warrant.\\nFor those who wish to pay their respects, the burial will take place at the Central Texas State Veterans Cemetery. Community members are encouraged to share this message widely and stand united in honoring the memory of a veteran who served our country with honor and distinction.\",\"answer\":\"Here is a summary of the article in 88 words:\\n\\nThe Central Texas State Veterans Cemetery is hosting a burial ceremony for U.S. Army Corporal Mirl Duane Forrest, who served from 1954 to 1963. Due to no known next of kin, the community is invited to attend and pay their respects. The ceremony will include military honors, and your presence can show appreciation for his service.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":159},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":159,\"byte_end\":486},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":486,\"byte_end\":820},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":820,\"byte_end\":863},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":863,\"byte_end\":940},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":940,\"byte_end\":1062},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1062,\"byte_end\":1153},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1153,\"byte_end\":1213},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1213,\"byte_end\":1310},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1310,\"byte_end\":1485},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1485,\"byte_end\":1620},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1620,\"byte_end\":1744},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1744,\"byte_end\":1920},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1920,\"byte_end\":2035},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":2035,\"byte_end\":2200}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":279},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":279,\"byte_end\":378}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
