4.35.626.098 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"5096 Carpinteria Ave\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":false,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Restaurants, Tex-Mex\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Carpinteria\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:30\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:30\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:30\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:30\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:30\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:30\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:0-21:30\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cielo\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2016-01-18 00:54:33\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Finally it closed!  It was pathetic.  All over the place menu.  Revolving door waitresses, completely lacked organization\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2015-11-04 02:45:40\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"This is a great little Restaurant.  I have a business near by and recommend it to our customers, who all come back to say they loved it!  I eat there often myself and always find the staff friendly and the food fresh and delicious.  Try it out, it is a delightful experience.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2015-10-17 21:32:56\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I love to come and get a drink here with some friends (drinks are good and strong btw) but for some reason whenever I come, there is a lack of service, it seems like you have to get up and ask for things around here. It's such a shame since they have okay food, but the time they take to bring you your food/drinks and even the menus is dramatically long.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Sure! Here's an objective overview of Cielo, based on the provided structured data:\\n\\nCielo is a Tex-Mex restaurant located in Carpinteria, California. It has a rating of 3.0 stars based on reviews from customers. The restaurant offers outdoor seating, takeout, and reservations, and accepts major credit cards. The menu features a variety of Tex-Mex dishes, including tacos, burritos, and quesadillas. Some reviewers have praised the restaurant's fresh and delicious food, while others have complained about slow service and disorganization. One reviewer described the restaurant as \\\"a great little spot\\\" with friendly staff and a delightful experience, while another reviewer criticized the lack of service and long wait times. Overall, Cielo appears to be a mixed bag, with some patrons enjoying their experiences and others being disappointed.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":805},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":805,\"byte_end\":823},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":823,\"byte_end\":849},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":849,\"byte_end\":1016},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1016,\"byte_end\":1118},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1118,\"byte_end\":1213},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1213,\"byte_end\":1546},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1546,\"byte_end\":1701}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":6},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":6,\"byte_end\":151},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":151,\"byte_end\":213},{\"index\":3,\"by