to the early 20th century when it was already known as a popular destination for spring breakers and retirees.\\n3. The area was originally named Long Beach Resort, and was owned by the Churchwell family in the mid-20th century. One of the family members, Guy Churchwell, became the mayor of the area before it was incorporated into the City of Panama City Beach in the 1970s.\\n\\nTherefore, the main historical events related to the area now known as Panama City Beach are:\\n\\n* Early human settlement dating back thousands of years\\n* Development as a tourist destination in the early 20th century\\n* Name change to Panama City Beach in the 1970s\\n\\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":172},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":172,\"byte_end\":430},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":430,\"byte_end\":458},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":458,\"byte_end\":602},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":602,\"byte_end\":713},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":713,\"byte_end\":718},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":718,\"byte_end\":780},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":780,\"byte_end\":889},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":889,\"byte_end\":979},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":979,\"byte_end\":1009},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1009,\"byte_end\":1084},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1084,\"byte_end\":1256}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":281},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":281,\"byte_end\":468},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":468,\"byte_end\":584},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":584,\"byte_end\":733},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":733,\"byte_end\":1039}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
