narch were in our area of Los Angeles, it would cost double the price and be booked out months in advance. In response to those reviewers complaining about price point, portions, and \\\\\\\"fanciness,\\\\\\\" please don't review all restaurants using a fixed scale. Would you complain about a Beethoven symphony because you wanted Spice Girls instead?\\\\n\\\\nMonarch = Beethoven.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"The Monarch is a highly-rated restaurant located in Santa Barbara, California, offering a unique dining experience with a focus on creative, farm-to-table cuisine. According to reviewers, the food is exceptional, with dishes described as \\\"meticulously crafted\\\" and \\\"Michelin-worthy.\\\" The menu offers a variety of options, including small plates, seafood, and meat dishes, and the restaurant is known for its use of fresh, locally-sourced ingredients. The atmosphere is upscale yet intimate, with a classy and trendy ambiance. While some reviewers have noted that the prices are higher than average, many agree that the quality of the food and the overall dining experience make it well worth the cost. Additionally, the restaurant offers a great value with its tasting menu, which is described as a \\\"great value for money.\\\" The Monarch is open for dinner Wednesday through Sunday, and reservations are recommended. Overall, The Monarch is a must-visit for foodies and those looking for a unique dining experience in the Santa Barbara area.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":885},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":885,\"byte_end\":956},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":956,\"byte_end\":987},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":987,\"byte_end\":1030},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1030,\"byte_end\":1061},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1061,\"byte_end\":1089},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1089,\"byte_end\":1120},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1120,\"byte_end\":1164},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1164,\"byte_end\":1174},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":11