er medium heat, then cover the pressure cooker with the lid and lock it.\\n5. Cook until the pressure indicator reaches high pressure (15 psi) and maintain pressure, reducing heat as needed.\\n6. Cook for 20 minutes.\\n7. Remove from heat and let stand until the pressure indicator shows no pressure.\\n\\nNote that the exact cooking time may vary depending on the type of beans and their age, so it's best to check them periodically to ensure they're tender but not mushy.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":37},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":37,\"byte_end\":99},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":99,\"byte_end\":165},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":165,\"byte_end\":216},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":216,\"byte_end\":286},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":286,\"byte_end\":362},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":362,\"byte_end\":483},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":483,\"byte_end\":523},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":523,\"byte_end\":676},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":676,\"byte_end\":820},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":820,\"byte_end\":862},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":862,\"byte_end\":924},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":924,\"byte_end\":989},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":989,\"byte_end\":1101}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":122},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":122,\"byte_end\":172},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":172,\"byte_end\":271},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":271,\"byte_end\":365},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":365,\"byte_end\":481},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":481,\"byte_end\":505},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":505,\"byte_end\":588},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":588,\"byte_end\":755}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
