lie Hebdo. The two brothers blamed for that attack, Cherif and Said Kouachi, were killed on January 9 after a violent standoff at an industrial site. The terror attacks claimed the lives of 17 people and put France on a heightened state of alert. CNN's Ariana Williams reported from Paris, and Laura Smith-Spark wrote from London. CNN's Pierre Meilhan contributed to this report.\\n\",\"answer\":\"Six survivors of the Paris kosher supermarket siege in January have filed a lawsuit against French media outlet BFMTV for endangering their lives during the hostage situation. The survivors claim that BFMTV broadcasted their location live during the siege, putting them at risk. BFMTV has responded by saying that they only mentioned the presence of a woman once, based on police sources, and regret any concern it may have caused. The supermarket siege was part of a series of terror attacks in Paris in January, which claimed the lives of 17 people.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":180},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":180,\"byte_end\":361},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":361,\"byte_end\":557},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":557,\"byte_end\":735},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":735,\"byte_end\":817},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":817,\"byte_end\":895},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":895,\"byte_end\":1065},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1065,\"byte_end\":1245},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1245,\"byte_end\":1301},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1301,\"byte_end\":1495},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1495,\"byte_end\":1678},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1678,\"byte_end\":1817},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1817,\"byte_end\":1914},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1914,\"byte_end\":1998},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1998,\"byte_end\":2047}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":176},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":176,\"byte_end\":279},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":279,\"byte_end\":432},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":432,\"byte_end\":551}]