d don't know about Gray's death. CNN's Suzanne Malveaux, Shawn Nottingham, AnneClaire Stapleton, Julian Cummings, Chris Cuomo, Ben Brumfield and Dana Ford contributed to this report.\\n\",\"answer\":\"On Tuesday evening, protesters rallied in Baltimore to demand justice for Freddie Gray, who died of a spinal injury a week after being arrested by police. Despite the release of the names of the officers involved, the protest remained peaceful, with demonstrators holding hands and chanting slogans. Baltimore Mayor Stephanie Rawlings-Blake expressed her understanding of the protesters' frustration and promised to find out how Gray died. The Justice Department is also investigating the incident, and the Baltimore Police Department plans to conclude its investigation by Friday. The case will then be sent to the state's attorney's office to decide whether to file charges. The mayor has requested an external investigation, citing Baltimore's history of police misconduct. The protesters called for justice and accountability, while the mayor vowed to address the systemic issues within the police department.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":22},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":22,\"byte_end\":33},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":33,\"byte_end\":174},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":174,\"byte_end\":261},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":261,\"byte_end\":343},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":343,\"byte_end\":425},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":425,\"byte_end\":494},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":494,\"byte_end\":523},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":523,\"byte_end\":599},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":599,\"byte_end\":669},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":669,\"byte_end\":700},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":700,\"byte_end\":769},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":769,\"byte_end\":910},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":910,\"byte_end\":945},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":945,\"byte_end\":1123},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1123,\"byte_end\":1237},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":1237,\"byte_end\":1251},{\"ind