n Peru and is expected to arrive back to South Korea on April 27. CNN's Paula Hancocks contributed to this report.\\n\",\"answer\":\"Sure! Here's the summary in 70 words:\\n\\nSouth Korea's Prime Minister Lee Wan-koo offered to resign amid a political scandal over alleged bribery and corruption. Seven politicians, including Lee and those linked to President Park Geun-hye, are under investigation. Lee denies allegations, but the President is taking them seriously and has promised to root out corruption.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":114},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":114,\"byte_end\":217},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":217,\"byte_end\":348},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":348,\"byte_end\":461},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":461,\"byte_end\":777},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":777,\"byte_end\":875},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":875,\"byte_end\":949},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":949,\"byte_end\":1069},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1069,\"byte_end\":1146},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1146,\"byte_end\":1211},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1211,\"byte_end\":1321},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1321,\"byte_end\":1410},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1410,\"byte_end\":1440},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1440,\"byte_end\":1519},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1519,\"byte_end\":1595},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1595,\"byte_end\":1719}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":6},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":6,\"byte_end\":160},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":160,\"byte_end\":263},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":263,\"byte_end\":370}]}"}], "temperature": 0, "seed": 70781, "max_tokens": 256, "stream": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}, "grammar": "root ::= r0 \"\\n\" r1 \"\\n\" r2 \"\\n\" r3\nr0 ::= \"0|\" relation \"|\" probability \"|\" refs\nr1 ::= \"1|\" relation \"|\" probability \"|\" refs\nr2 ::= \"2|\" relation \"|\" probability \"|\" refs\nr3 ::= \"3|\" relation \"|\" probability \"|\" refs