 price\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-24 22:01:45\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"They say in life, breakups don't call for many words...\\\\nWith that said.\\\\nI don't see me marrying the idea of making this restaurant \\\\nA staple in my diet..\\\\n\\\\nI came here on a Saturday night,\\\\nHungry.\\\\nIt was all due to burrito week in Santa Barbara.\\\\nSo I thought I would give them a try.\\\\nI went with the featured burrito.\\\\n\\\\nThe burrito was big.\\\\nEnough for two\\\\nNothing that screams \\\\\\\"oh my\\\\\\\"\\\\nOr, wow.\\\\nIt was just a burrito \\\\nBasic.\\\\nThough a bit dry.\\\\nThe wrap getting unwrapped \\\\nIt's like the burrito was fighting with me\\\\n( I will have you know I won the battle)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nThe atmosphere was cool, quiet, and a bit reflective \\\\nThey weren't busy.\\\\nCustomer service was standard.\\\\nNothing below or over the top \\\\n\\\\nSo what's my next plan of action?\\\\nI will try two more items from them\\\\nMy Situation could have been a complete fluke\\\\n\\\\nStay tuned....\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Super Cuca's Restaurant is a Mexican eatery located at 626 W Micheltorena St in Santa Barbara, California. The restaurant offers a variety of dishes, including burgers, salads, and burritos. It operates seven days a week from 6 pm to 10 pm. The restaurant has several attributes, such as outdoor seating, takeout options, and good food for groups. Additionally, it has WiFi available. The restaurant has four stars out of five and has received positive reviews from its customers. One customer praised the restaurant for having the freshest and best burritos in town, while another appreciated the restaurant's specials. Another customer felt that the restaurant was not a staple in their diet and did not feel impressed with their experience. Overall, Super Cuca's Restaurant seems to be a popular spot for Mexican food in Santa Barbara, with a mix of positive and neutral reviews from its customers.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":828},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":828,\"byte_end\":864},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":864,\"byte_end\":916},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":916,\"byte_end\":985},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":985,\"byte_end\":1136},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1136,\"byte_end\":1211},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1211,\"byte_end\":1233},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1233,\"byte_end\":2280}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":107},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":107,\"byte_end\":191},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":191,\"byte_end\":241},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":241,\"byte_end\":348},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":348,\"byte_end\":385},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":385,\"byte_end\":481},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":481,\"byte_end\":621},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":621,\"byte_end\":744},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":744,\"byte_end\":901}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
