6.18.768.610 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"211 Helena Ave\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":true,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":true,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":true,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":null,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":false,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":null,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Nightlife, Bars, Tiki Bars, Cocktail Bars\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"14:0-2:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"16:0-1:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"14:0-2:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"14:0-1:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"16:0-1:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"16:0-1:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"16:0-1:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Test Pilot\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2022-01-17 17:30:36\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"This place has pretty good tiki cocktails but I wouldn't say this is a tiki bar more nautical themed. We got the buccaneer, which comes in a young coconut, and the Thai iced tiki. I wasn't a fan of the Thai iced tiki. I thought the all spice was a little overpowering but it was still a fun drink with the popping liquid pearls on top. The buccaneer was also fresh and I liked that it was in a coconut because we were able to eat as a side snack!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2022-01-15 21:13:30\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"This was a really fun bar to go to. Great crowd on a Sunday funday. They have nice outdoor seating. Drink prices are reasonable and taste phenomenal. Perfect for a date or a fun hang.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2022-01-06 02:49:11\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Stumbled upon this bar Sunday around 3pm while we were exploring Funkzone; it was relatively empty so we were able to sit wherever we wanted. \\\\n\\\\nThe bartender is knowledgeable and accommodating, the cups for cocktails are very instagram-able if that's your thing, and the decor is well thought out with open-air beach vibes. \\\\n\\\\nThe drink list is LONG and had something for everyone in our group- strong drinks, creative drinks, and twist on classic drinks. \\\\n\\\\nDefinitely recommend a pit stop here if you're in the mood for a creative cocktail!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Test Pilot is a nightlife business located at 211 Helena Ave in Santa Barbara, CA. The business offers a variety of services including bars, tiki bars, and cocktail bars. The hours of operation vary depending on the day of the week, with Monday through Saturday open from 4 pm to 1 am, and Sunday open from 4 pm to 1 am.\\n\\nCustomers have praised the bar's selection of tiki cocktails, particularly the Buccaneer and Thai Iced Tiki. The outdoor seating area has been described as comfortable and inviting, making it a great spot for a date or a fun hangout. The drink prices have also been noted as reasonable and the cocktails have a unique and delicious taste.\\n\\nIn addition to the tiki-themed drinks, Test Pilot also offers a wide range of creative cocktails, as well as a variety of classic drinks with a twist. The bartenders at the bar are known for being knowledgeable and accommodating, and the decor is described as well thought out with an open-air beach vibe. Overall, Test Pilot is a great spot for those looking for a unique and fun nightlife experience in Santa Barbara.\",\"source_segmen