6.27.769.536 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"passages\\\":\\\"passage 1:This illness, known as primary or acute HIV infection, may last for a few weeks. Possible signs and symptoms include: 1  Fever. 2  Headache. 3  Muscle aches and joint pain. 4  Rash. 5  Sore throat. 6  Swollen lymph glands, mainly on the neck.\\\\n\\\\npassage 2:Common AIDS symptoms in men include: 1  swollen lymph glands. 2  unusual lesions on the tongue; skin rashes and bumps. 3  nausea, vomiting, and diarrhea. 4  cough and shortness of breath. 5  chronic fatigue. 6  fever, chills, and night sweats. 7  rapid weight loss. 8  blurred or distorted vision. 9  other symptoms of infection or disease.\\\\n\\\\npassage 3:HIV symptoms in women include: 1  fever. 2  swollen lymph nodes. 3  sore throat. 4  skin rash. 5  muscle soreness. 6  joint pain. 7  fatigue. 8  nausea/vomiting. 9  night sweats.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"aids hiv symptoms\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Symptoms of HIV and AIDS can include fever, swollen lymph glands, sore throat, skin rash, muscle aches and joint pain, unusual lesions on the tongue, nausea, vomiting, and diarrhea, cough and shortness of breath, chronic fatigue, chills, and night sweats, rapid weight loss, blurred or distorted vision, and other symptoms of infection or disease. These symptoms may vary slightly between men and women.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":104},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":104,\"byte_end\":151},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":151,\"byte_end\":164},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":164,\"byte_end\":196},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":196,\"byte_end\":205},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":205,\"byte_end\":221},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":221,\"