it the song in half on its A and B sides.) The draft that was auctioned is 16 pages: 237 lines of manuscript and 26 lines of typed text, according to Christie's. It includes lines that didn't make the final version as well as extensive notes -- all of which should be revealing, McLean said. The record for a popular music manuscript is held by Bob Dylan's \\\"Like a Rolling Stone,\\\" which sold for $2 million in June. Opinion: What's so great about 'American Pie'?\\n\",\"answer\":\"The lyrics to Don McLean's iconic song \\\"American Pie\\\" were sold for $1.2 million at an auction held by Christie's. The manuscript achieved the third highest auction price for an American literary manuscript. McLean, who is turning 70 this year, decided to part with the manuscript to secure a good deal for his family. The song, which has been analyzed extensively, was inspired by the death of Buddy Holly, but the meaning behind the rest of the lyrics has been subject to interpretation. The auctioned draft includes lines that didn't make the final version and extensive notes. The record for a popular music manuscript is held by Bob Dylan's \\\"Like a Rolling Stone.\\\"\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":33},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":33,\"byte_end\":145},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":145,\"byte_end\":383},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":383,\"byte_end\":455},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":455,\"byte_end\":531},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":531,\"byte_end\":619},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":619,\"byte_end\":668},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":668,\"byte_end\":680},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":680,\"byte_end\":795},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":795,\"byte_end\":1044},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1044,\"byte_end\":1069},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1069,\"byte_end\":1096},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1096,\"byte_end\":1140},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1140,\"byte_end\":1213},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1213,\"byte_end\":1289},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1289,\"byte_end\"