lots more.Our website works with many of the products listed as having variations.ou can browse our complete range of products, from the many orchid pots, plant clips, bark, charcoal, to a rainbow of colours in labels and lots, lots more.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"orchid bark with charcoal\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Based on the given passages, it is mentioned that charcoal can be added to orchid mix to keep the mix sweet and filter impurities. The particle size of this charcoal is appropriate for most orchid mixes, ranging from 1/2 to 1 inch. It is also mentioned that charcoal is not finely graded and some smaller and larger pieces may be mixed in. However, there is no specific mention of using charcoal along with orchid bark for the purpose of growing orchids. Therefore, based on the given passages, it cannot be confirmed whether orchid bark with charcoal is used for growing orchids.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":52},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":52,\"byte_end\":112},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":112,\"byte_end\":215},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":215,\"byte_end\":373},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":373,\"byte_end\":473},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":473,\"byte_end\":526},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":526,\"byte_end\":624},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":624,\"byte_end\":781},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":781,\"byte_end\":890},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":890,\"byte_end\":1013},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1013,\"byte_end\":1153},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1153,\"byte_end\":1217},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1217,\"byte_end\":1346},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1346,\"byte_end\":1414},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1414,\"byte_end\":1466},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1466,\"byte_end\":1896}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":131},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":131,\"byte_end\":232},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":232,\"byte_end\":340},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":340,\"byte_end\":455},{\