ws about the food and service provided by Panino. One customer mentioned being pleasantly surprised by the English Stilton and pear sandwich, praising its taste and recommending it to others. They also expressed satisfaction with other sandwiches like the Turkey and Salami, Cobb Salad Sandwich, and Caprese Sandwich. Another customer, who had driven from Oxnard, highly recommended Panino for its great sandwiches and friendly service. A third customer praised the Italian combo sandwich on focaccia, highlighting the delicious combination of meats, cheeses, and basil aioli. They expressed a strong preference for this sandwich and mentioned that the prices are slightly higher than average.\\n\\nOverall, Panino is a local business in Goleta known for its delicious sandwiches, friendly service, and a variety of options on their menu.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":873},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":873,\"byte_end\":1129},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1129,\"byte_end\":1153},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1153,\"byte_end\":1310},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1310,\"byte_end\":1363},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1363,\"byte_end\":1558},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1558,\"byte_end\":1621},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1621,\"byte_end\":1646},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1646,\"byte_end\":1661},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1661,\"byte_end\":1736},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1736,\"byte_end\":1799},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1799,\"byte_end\":1839},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1839,\"byte_end\":1871},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1871,\"byte_end\":1922},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1922,\"byte_end\":2117},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2117,\"byte_end\":2162},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2162,\"byte_end\":2313},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2313,\"byte_end\":2451},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":2451,\"byte_end\":2540},{\"index\":19,\"byte_start\":2540,\"byte_end\":2627},{\"index\":20,\"byte_start\":2627,\"byte_end\":2727},{\"index\":21,\"byte_start\":2727,\"byte