e options for kids and any adult with some healthy choices to go with it. I stick to the charburger with cheese or the steak sandwich, can't really be disappointed. There is also a kids meal that includes a great apple juice and fries for those kids who just have to have them! No matter what get the tempura green beans and onion rings; heck, you could skip the burgers and just have those!!! Easy parking and a buzzer if you want to wait in car with the kids.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Welcome to Habit Burger Grill, located in the heart of Santa Barbara, CA. This casual restaurant serves up delicious burgers made with quality ingredients, as well as other tasty menu options. With a rating of 4.0 stars and rave reviews, Habit Burger Grill is a top choice for anyone looking for a satisfying meal.\\n\\nThe restaurant's menu offers a variety of options, including classic burgers, salads, and sandwiches, making it easy to find something for everyone. Customers rave about the restaurant's signature Charburger, which features a freshly ground beef patty topped with lettuce, tomato, pickles, and a tangy sauce. Vegetarians and vegans will appreciate the restaurant's plant-based options, such as the Impossible Burger and the Tempura Green Beans.\\n\\nOne of the standout features of Habit Burger Grill is their commitment to using fresh, high-quality ingredients. All burgers are made with 100% pure beef, and the produce is always fresh and locally sourced whenever possible. This attention to detail is evident in every dish that comes out of the kitchen.\\n\\nCustomers also appreciate the friendly and attentive service at Habit Burger Grill. The staff is known for being welcoming and accommodating, making sure that every guest feels valued and taken care of. Whether you're grabbing a quick lunch or meeting friends for dinner, the atmosphere is casual and inviting.\\n\\nIn addition to their great food and service, Habit Burger Grill also offers easy parking and a convenient buzzer system for those who prefer to wait in their cars. And for families with kids, the restaurant has a children's menu that includes healthy options and a fun tempura green beans and onion rings appetizer that is sure to please even the pickiest eaters.\\n\\nOverall, Habit Burger Grill is an excellent choice for anyone looking for a delicious, satisfying meal in a casual and welcoming environment. With its focus on quality ingredients, attentive service, and family-friendly atmosphere, it's no wonder this restaurant has earned such high praise from customers.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":955},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":955,\"byte_end\":1015},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1015,\"byte_end\":1028},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1028,\"byte_end\":1063},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1063,\"byte_end\":1125},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1125,\"byte_end\":1314},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1314,\"byte_end\":1396},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1396,\"byte_end\":1487},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1487,\"byte_end\":1600},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1600,\"byte_end\":1716},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1716,\"byte_end\":1800}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":74},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":74,\"byte_end\":193},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":193,\"byte_end\":316},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":316,\"byte_end\":465},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":465,\"byte_end\":625},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":625,\"byte_end\":762},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":762,\"byte_end\":875},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":875,\"byte_end\":988},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":988,\"byte_end\":1070},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1070,\"byte_end\":1154},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1154,\"byte_end\":1273},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1273,\"byte_end\":1382},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1382,\"byte_end\":1546},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1546,\"byte_end\":1747},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1747,\"byte_end\":1