a convenient buzzer system for those who prefer to wait in their cars. And for families with kids, the restaurant has a children's menu that includes healthy options and a fun tempura green beans and onion rings appetizer that is sure to please even the pickiest eaters.\\n\\nOverall, Habit Burger Grill is an excellent choice for anyone looking for a delicious, satisfying meal in a casual and welcoming environment. With its focus on quality ingredients, attentive service, and family-friendly atmosphere, it's no wonder this restaurant has earned such high praise from customers.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":955},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":955,\"byte_end\":1015},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1015,\"byte_end\":1028},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1028,\"byte_end\":1063},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1063,\"byte_end\":1125},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1125,\"byte_end\":1314},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1314,\"byte_end\":1396},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1396,\"byte_end\":1487},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1487,\"byte_end\":1600},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1600,\"byte_end\":1716},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1716,\"byte_end\":1800}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[8,9,10,11,12,13,14,15],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":74},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":74,\"byte_end\":193},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":193,\"byte_end\":316},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":316,\"byte_end\":465},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":465,\"byte_end\":625},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":625,\"byte_end\":762},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":762,\"byte_end\":875},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":875,\"byte_end\":988},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":988,\"byte_end\":1070},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1070,\"byte_end\":1154},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1154,\"byte_end\":1273},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1273,\"byte_end\":1382},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1382,\"byte_end\":1546},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1546,\"byte_end\":1747},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1747,\"byte_e