cessary after a 20 minute break.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how to cure a swollen foot\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Based on the given passages, adding Epsom salts to a bath or swimming or floating in water can help with swollen feet and ankles by reducing the swelling. Additionally, resting the injured ankle or foot and using an ice pack can also help with swelling. It is important to note that seeking medical advice is recommended if concerned about swollen feet or ankles.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":106},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":106,\"byte_end\":221},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":221,\"byte_end\":288},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":288,\"byte_end\":401},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":401,\"byte_end\":553},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":553,\"byte_end\":626},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":626,\"byte_end\":726},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":726,\"byte_end\":945},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":945,\"byte_end\":1097},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1097,\"byte_end\":1170},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1170,\"byte_end\":1212},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1212,\"byte_end\":1307},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1307,\"byte_end\":1381},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1381,\"byte_end\":1554},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1554,\"byte_end\":1748}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":155},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":155,\"byte_end\":254},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":254,\"byte_end\":363}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
