"top_p","min_p","xtc","temperature"],"speculative.types":"none","timings_per_token":false,"post_sampling_probs":false,"backend_sampling":false,"lora":[]},"next_token":[{"has_next_token":false,"has_new_line":false,"n_remain":179,"n_decoded":77}],"prompt":"<|im_start|>user\n{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"216 W Cabrillo Blvd\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":true,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":null,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":null,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Diners, Salad, American (Traditional), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"7:0-14:30\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"7:0-14:30\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"7:0-14:30\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"7:0-14:30\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"7:0-14:30\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"7:0-14:30\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"7:0-14:30\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Chad's\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2022-01-19 02:02:14\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"The absolute BEST eggs benedict (the Californian) that I've ever had.  From the light slightly lemony sauce (not thick and gelatinous) to the soft perfect muffin and am ample perfect amount of spinach ... PERFECT.  JUST PERFECT.\\\\n\\\\nThe mimosa flight was stunning as well!\\\\n\\\\nThanks Chads - we will be back.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2022-01-16 21:30:42\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"This place is magical!!!  I would like to give this establishment 10 Stars. We arrived to meet an anticipated Sunday Brunch crowd. The magic begins here! As we waited under the sun blocking covering, we listened to great music over Bose speakers!!! We swayed and enjoyed the day. The owner, Chad, served us delightful muffins and thanked us for coming out then... Mark, the magician, gave us an AWESOME  show!!! Kiri, our waitress, was superior and this place was a WHOLE EXPERIENCE. The food is DELICIOUS!  Visit Chad's! You deserve the best!!!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2022-01-16 19:45:18\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We had breakfast at Chad's this morning and it did not disappoint. We were appreciative and impressed by their attentive service and delicious food. Their complimentary mini muffins to start are so good! We love Chad and everything he brings to our community. Thank you!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Chad's, located at 216 W Cabrillo Blvd in Santa Barbara, CA, is a traditional American diner known for its salads, breakfast, and brunch. Open daily from 7:00 to 14:30, the restaurant offers outdoor seating and free WiFi, and it caters to groups. While reservations are not accepted, there are street and lot parking options available. Chad's maintains a casual yet classy ambiance, as noted in the attributes. The restaurant has an overall rating of 4 stars. Customers have highlighted the quality of the food - particularly the Californian eggs benedict and complimentary mini muffins - as well as the attentive service, and one even referred to the restaurant as a \\\"whole experience\\\". The owner, Chad, was also praised for his personal involvement.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":899},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":899,\"byte_end\":1033},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1033,\"byte_end\":1043},{\"index\