can be cooked in a toaster oven. Passage 2 states that you can use a toaster oven to cook pork chops by setting the temperature the same as a regular oven and placing them on a baking sheet. The cooking time may vary depending on the thickness of the meat, but on average, it takes about half an hour. Passage 3 also mentions that pork chops should be baked for 45 minutes in a convection oven at 325\u00b0F, which suggests that a toaster oven can be used as well. Therefore, it is possible to cook pork chops in a toaster oven.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":63},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":63,\"byte_end\":103},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":103,\"byte_end\":153},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":153,\"byte_end\":214},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":214,\"byte_end\":259},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":259,\"byte_end\":299},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":299,\"byte_end\":349},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":349,\"byte_end\":410},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":410,\"byte_end\":508},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":508,\"byte_end\":608},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":608,\"byte_end\":835},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":835,\"byte_end\":1061},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1061,\"byte_end\":1163},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1163,\"byte_end\":1189},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1189,\"byte_end\":1313},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1313,\"byte_end\":1492}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":89},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":89,\"byte_end\":247},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":247,\"byte_end\":358},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":358,\"byte_end\":517},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":517,\"byte_end\":580}]}"}], "temperature": 0, "seed": 70781, "max_tokens": 256, "stream": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}, "grammar": "root ::= r0 \"\\n\" r1 \"\\n\" r2 \"\\n\" r3 \"\\n\" r4\nr0 ::= \"0|\" relation \"|\" probability \"|\" refs\nr1 ::= \"1|\" relation \"|\" probability \"|\" refs\nr2 ::= \"2|\" relation \"|\"