9.59.682.835 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"passages\\\":\\\"passage 1:The two-toed sloth is slightly bigger than the three-toed sloth, though they share many of the same features. They are about the size of a medium-sized dog at around 23 to 27 inches (58 to 68 cm) and 17.5 to 18.75 pounds (about 8 kilograms).he two-toed sloth is slightly bigger than the three-toed sloth, though they share many of the same features. They are about the size of a medium-sized dog at around 23 to 27 inches (58 to 68 cm) and 17.5 to 18.75 pounds (about 8 kilograms).\\\\n\\\\npassage 2:1 Two-toed and three-toed sloths were formerly placed in the same family but the two genera have profound behavioral and anatomical differences and are believed to come from two different fossil lineages. 2  They are now placed in separate families. 3  2-toed is larger, faster, and nocturnal. Long limbs \u2014 forelegs only slightly longer than hind legs (3-toed sloth's forelegs are 35% longer than hind legs). 2  Two-toed sloths have hands with two functioning fingers with sharp claws 76 - 102 mm (3 - 4 inches). 3  Three-toed sloths have three fingers on their hands. 4  Three claws on hind limbs.\\\\n\\\\npassage 3:1 Besides the fact that one has two toes on its forelimbs and the other three, they have different numbers of vertebrae (three-toed ones have nine; two-toed ones have six or seven). 2  Also, Three-toed sloths have a small tail and its forelegs are substantially longer than the rear ones.ifference Between Two and Three Toed Sloths: 1  Besides the fact that one has two toes on its forelimbs and the other three, they have different numbers of vertebrae (three-toed ones have nine; two-toed ones have six or seven).\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"what makes the two toed sloth different\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Jeannine\u2019s American Bakery & Restaurant is located on 1 State Street in Santa Barbara, California. It belongs to several categories including Food, Bakeries, Restaurants, Patisserie/Cake Shop, Cafes, and Coffee & Tea. The business operates from Monday to Sunday with hours varying slightly each day. Customers can park their vehicles on the street or in a nearby lot, but valet parking is not available. There are no reservations required for this restaurant, and both indoor and outdoor seating options are available. WiFi is free, and takeout is also offered. \\n\\nThe restaurant has received positive reviews from its customers. One customer praised the Kahula Banana French toast as \\\"amazing\\\" and noted that the service was excellent. Another customer commended the location and the food quality, while a third customer appreciated the fast service and the lovely seating area. Overall, Jeannine\u2019s American Bakery & Restaurant seems like a popular spot for breakfast with good food, service, and ambiance.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":133},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":133,\"byte_end\":373},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":373,\"byte_end\":723},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":723,\"byte_end\":768},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":768,\"byte_end\":812},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":812,\"byte_end\":929},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":929,\"byte_end\":1033},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1033,\"byte_end\":1089},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1089,\"byte_end\":1314},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1314,\"byte_end\":1706}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":101},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":101,\"byte_end\":220},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":220,\"byte_end\":302},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":302,\"byte_end\":406},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":406,\"byte_en