10.02.304.715 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"3375 Foothill Rd, Ste 6333\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":null,\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":false,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Caterers, Restaurants, Mexican, Event Planning & Services, Food, Tacos, Bartenders, Food Delivery Services\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Carpinteria\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"9:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"9:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"8:0-17:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Rasta Taco Catering\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2019-10-17 02:27:02\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Absolutely wonderful way to spice up any event! Mario and his crew knock it out of the park!  The margarita truck added such a fun atmosphere to my party! Highly recommend the cucumber jalapeno margarita!  I would book this for any future event here!  Thank you Rasta Rita!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-07-12 16:42:49\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Rasta Rita was used for a military event and was such a hit! Mario is super friendly to work with and is always willing to help out.  The truck was so fun and the drinks were delicious! Everyone at our event had such a fun time interacting with the truck and sipping the yummy margaritas.  What an amazing concept!  We are using the truck again this year as it has been such a hot item!!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2017-07-31 03:14:02\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Mario was freaking amazing !!!! He was so charismatic and instinctful !! He's defiantly a one man show !! I would refer him for any event !! He bartender my friend Pilar wedding and did a amazing job !!!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Based on the provided passages, the main differences between the two-toed sloth (Choloepus didactylus) and the three-toed sloth (Bradypus variegatus) are:\\n\\n1. Number of toes on the front limbs: The two-toed sloth has two toes on each front limb, while the three-toed sloth has three toes.\\n2. Size: The two-toed sloth is generally smaller than the three-toed sloth, with a length of around 23-27 inches (58-68 cm) and a weight of around 17.5-18.75 pounds (about 8 kilograms), compared to the three-toed sloth's length of around 30-40 inches (76-102 cm) and weight of around 20-30 pounds (around 9-14 kilograms).\\n3. Limb structure: The two-toed sloth has longer limbs overall, with the forelegs being slightly longer than the hind legs, while the three-toed sloth has shorter forelegs that are 35% longer than the hind legs.\\n4. Hand structure: The two-toed sloth has hands with two functioning fingers and sharp claws, while the three-toed sloth has three fingers on its hands.\\n5. Vertebral count: The two-toed sloth has six or seven vertebrae in its body, while the three-toed sloth has nine vertebrae.\\n6. Tail length: The three-toed sloth has a smaller tail than the two-toed sloth.\\n7. Forelimb length: The three-toed sloth has substantially longer forelegs than the rear legs, while the two-toed sloth has more balanced proportions.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":786},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":786,\"byte_end\":832},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":832,\"byte_end\":893},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start